team/apps/1601770/extras/f47df838ac63e540c56b59318eca5f47.mp4?t=1768496367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using only their wits, their cybernetics, and a unique array of special abilities, the player will become the runner in this fast-paced, kinetic VR experience. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br>RUNNER features visceral first-person arcade driving combat that embraces the unique visual style of late 1980\u2019s prestige anime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601770/extras/bdfa5f64247c895909a75efbbd50b865.webp?t=1768496367\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601770/extras/bdfa5f64247c895909a75efbbd50b865.poster.webp?t=1768496367\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Featuring high-speed combat, intense encounters and an incredible throwback soundtrack. When there's nowhere left to hide, the only way out is through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601770/extras/7f102e906e1010ed3daaa3e419dcd6e5.webp?t=1768496367\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601770/extras/7f102e906e1010ed3daaa3e419dcd6e5.poster.webp?t=1768496367\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d Freeform 360-degree VR shooting </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d Blisteringly fast motorcycle combat with full maneuvering control </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d Unlockable bikes with unique attributes and abilities </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d Intuitive gameplay with upgradeable sidearm mods </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d Combine mounted gun upgrades to create unique weapons </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d Utilize missiles and grenades as part of your arsenal </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d Deflect incoming fire with the energy saber </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d Execute time-bending special moves with R.U.S.H. mode </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d 7 massive levels unique to every playthrough </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d 3 Additional bonus stages now available, with more to come </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d Revisit stages at your leisure with the Level Select\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d Try 'Cruising' mode: just you, the music, and the road </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d High-speed encounters with varied enemy types </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d Chain together combos for massive scores </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d Enormous and intense boss encounters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d Fully-voiced narrative single-player experience </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d Featuring the voices of Steve Blum, Sandra Saad and Richard Epcar </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d Multiple difficulty and comfort options </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d Hidden achievements and global leaderboards  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d Features enhanced immersion with native bHaptics support </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u204d Includes a dynamic high-speed soundtrack by Fat Bard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The English release of\u00a0<strong>RUNNER</strong> also features the fully-produced, fully-voiced visual novel experience <strong>PREAMBLE</strong>\u00a0included for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PREAMBLE</strong> is a future-noir visual novel experience that tells the story of &quot;Vice,&quot; a former smuggler turned corporate cog on the colony world of N-351.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the events leading up to the opening moments of &lt;RUNNER&gt;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a fully voiced interactive narrative with a veteran cast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable CGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incredible vaporwave soundtrack composed by Fat Bard.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Truant Pixel, LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601770/6de3f97c5fbe3d9a1e7956d32bd9c65c2db59427/header.jpg?t=1768496367","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright Truant Pixel, LLC","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1601770/875926908/d52b1283d65dd368d9e64d27214cbdb58ffd37d9/1750870245/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750980771","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1601770/875926908/d52b1283d65dd368d9e64d27214cbdb58ffd37d9/1750870245/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750980771","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1601770/875926908/d52b1283d65dd368d9e64d27214cbdb58ffd37d9/1750870245/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750980771","id":257161435,"name":"Trailer_1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257161435/d0d7535f3beb9c12224ae64552c37e3325a514e6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750980771"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1601770/1279376013/c86f3f1c4e791bb9d747b4b99a741b98a6569ad9/1750876071/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750980777","dash_h264":"ht